    \\ &= n^{1/2-1/q} s_0(n)^{1/2-1/q}\bigg(\frac{\log n}{N}\bigg)^{1/2-q/4} 
\end{align*}
and we see that                                                                                          
$R^{-1}\delta \gtrsim n^{1-2/q}$ \eqref{eq:Rdelta_bound} holds if
\begin{align*}
